=======================form========================
Form is nothing but the container or structire where we can collect the user inputs, track the value, 
validity , whether it is touched or dirty. reacte to the value change, and submit the date. 
instead of capturing individual fields and values, from will wrap the html fileds and read the DOM values and validate

basically we can do this via 2 ways.
1. template driven form
2. reactive form.

1. Template driven form :
  is nornal form, where all logics and validation will take place in template.
  uses ngModel
  change detection will be heavy 

2.Reactive form:
  in reactive form, all our logics and validation will be in ts file,  so template will be just reflecting the values.
  in reactive form.

